    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classanonymous__namespace_02_g_c_root_lowering_8cpp_03_1_1_lower_intrinsics" kindref="compound">LowerIntrinsics</ref> - This pass rewrites calls to the llvm.gcread or llvm.gcwrite intrinsics, replacing them with simple loads and stores as directed by the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_g_c_strategy" kindref="compound">GCStrategy</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It also performs automatic root initialization and custom intrinsic lowering. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
